#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/sodium-ion.ipynb:9
msgid "DFN model for sodium-ion batteries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/sodium-ion.ipynb:11
msgid ""
"In this notebook we use the DFN model to simulate sodium-ion batteries. The "
"parameters are based on the article > K. Chayambuka, G. Mulder, D.L. "
"Danilov, P.H.L. Notten, Physics-based modeling of sodium-ion batteries part "
"II. Model and validation, Electrochimica Acta 404 (2022) 139764. https://doi."
"org/10.1016/j.electacta.2021.139764."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/sodium-ion.ipynb:13
msgid ""
"However, the specific values (including the data for the interpolants) are "
"taken from the COMSOL implementation presented in `this example <https://www."
"comsol.com/model/1d-isothermal-sodium-ion-battery-117341>`__. As usual, we "
"start by importing PyBaMM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/sodium-ion.ipynb:-1
msgid "[1]:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/sodium-ion.ipynb:-1
msgid "import pybamm"
msgstr ""

